				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				128,
				8
			],
			"Message": "feat(Grove): Extract transport layer into directory module\n\nAdd the Transport subdirectory with TransportConfig and TransportFactory modules, completing the Source-level atomization of the Grove crate. TransportConfig provides a builder-pattern configuration struct with connection/request timeouts, retry policy, and keepalive settings. TransportFactory exposes factory functions for gRPC, IPC, WASM, and feature-gated WebSocket transport creation.\n\nSimultaneously strip redundant doc comments (//! and ///) from the existing Protocol module files that merely repeated the type/variant names, add missing #[derive] macros (Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq, Hash) to MessageType and ProtocolConfig, and import protocol constants inline via super:: instead of opaque values.\n\nNormalize markdown table alignment in Architecture.md and README.md, replacing em dashes with hyphens in the Shim Compatibility section for consistent list formatting.\n\nThis establishes a clear Transport layer boundary alongside the existing Protocol layer for the Spine client-server interaction model.",
			"SHA": "b3741436cf1ebb1f77341d5345e6a819ee43ba64"
		}
	],
